<title>SPAIN: Spain okays sale of 3.8 pct Gas Natural.</title>
<headline>Spain okays sale of 3.8 pct Gas Natural.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Spanish government has approved the placement of its remaining 3.81 percent stake in energy group Gas Natural on the stock exchange, state holding company SEPI said on Friday.</p>
<p>The stake is equivalent to 1,423,520 shares to be sold via an institutional placement, 60 percent of which will be aimed at domestic investors, and 40 percent for international investors.</p>
<p>After the sale the government will have no stake in the company.</p>
</text>
